Welcome on this LABGRID CONTROLLER!

First usage: Check and in case adjust the hostname and device entries:
- devices in /etc/labgrid/*
- coordinator ip in /etc/systemd/system/labgrid-exporter.service
- hostname in /etc/systemd/system/labgrid-exporter.service

Enter labgrid environment:

    $ source ./labgrid-venv/bin/activate
    (labgrid-venv) pi@raspberrypi:~$

Start labgrid-exporter (after a labgrid-coordinator is runnign):

    $ sudo systemctl start labgrid-exporter

Turn gpio26 on/off

    $ sudo systemctl start/stop gpio26

